### Calls API Tests

This file exercises the call-room routes under `/api/calls`. See
docs/calls-architecture.md for how they work and what each returns.

Calls are off by default, so set `calls.enabled=true` for the local server
first; otherwise every request below answers 404 `calls_disabled`.

Install the **REST Client** extension in VS Code and select the `local`
environment. Configure the same `baseUrl`, `adminUid`, and `adminPassword`
variables used by `toolchain.http` in the Git-ignored
`.vscode/settings.json`. Never put passwords in this file.

The routes only answer requests that look like they come from an OCS page,
so each one sends `Origin` and `X-Origin: client`. Set `groupId` to a group
that exists on your server; the admin may open any group's room.

@pageOrigin = http://localhost:4500
@groupId = 1

### 1. Sign in

# @name loginCalls
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "uid": "{{adminUid}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### 2. Open the group's room -> 200 with the room (made the first time)

# @name openCall
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calls
Origin: {{pageOrigin}}
X-Origin: client
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "contextType": "GROUP",
  "contextKey": "{{groupId}}",
  "purpose": "standup"
}

### 3. Read the room -> 200 with the same id, state IDLE

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calls/{{openCall.response.body.id}}
Origin: {{pageOrigin}}
X-Origin: client
Accept: application/json

### 4. Open the CSA course room -> 200, contextKey "CSA"

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calls
Origin: {{pageOrigin}}
X-Origin: client
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "contextType": "COURSE",
  "contextKey": "csa"
}

### 5. A purpose calls.purposes doesn't list -> 400 UNKNOWN_PURPOSE

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calls
Origin: {{pageOrigin}}
X-Origin: client
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "contextType": "GROUP",
  "contextKey": "{{groupId}}",
  "purpose": "party"
}

### 6. Without the page headers -> 403 origin_rejected

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calls/{{openCall.response.body.id}}
Accept: application/json
